{"ts":"2026-08-30T12:21:58.020Z","stage":"plan","title":"Agent viết edit-doc (story + beat plan)","data":{"instruction":"Giọng điệu: người thợ đang chỉ trχει một sai lầm phổ biến — mỗi câu ngắn, gắt, kết bằng meta so sánh (clock/breath). Beat 1 là câu hỏi tu từ, beat 2 vạch ra gốc rễ vấn đề, beat 3 đưa ra quy tắc dùng được ngay.","idea":"Readable code is a gift to your future self","beats":[{"id":"rc-b1","treatment":"chapter-card","params":{"title":"WORKS BUT UNREADABLE","subtitle":"the daily tax","accent":"#f2b84b"},"transcript":"Code that works but nobody can read is technical debt you pay every single day.","plannedDurationSec":20},{"id":"rc-b2","treatment":"chapter-card","params":{"title":"NAMING IS CHEAP","subtitle":"one rename, three comments saved","accent":"#61d7e8"},"transcript":"Naming is the cheapest refactor. A good function name replaces three lines of comments.","plannedDurationSec":20},{"id":"rc-b3","treatment":"chapter-card","params":{"title":"ONE IDEA PER FUNCTION","subtitle":"structure beats cleverness","accent":"#2dd4a0"},"transcript":"Small functions are not about line count. They are about one idea per unit.","plannedDurationSec":20},{"id":"rc-b4","treatment":"chapter-card","params":{"title":"WHY NOT WHAT","subtitle":"comments are confessions","accent":"#f2b84b"},"transcript":"Comments explain WHY, never WHAT. If your comment describes the code, rewrite the code.","plannedDurationSec":20},{"id":"rc-b5","treatment":"chapter-card","params":{"title":"CONSISTENCY > CORRECTNESS","subtitle":"the pattern principle","accent":"#61d7e8"},"transcript":"Consistency beats correctness. A codebase that does the same thing the same way everywhere is readable even when it is wrong.","plannedDurationSec":25},{"id":"rc-b6","treatment":"chapter-card","params":{"title":"THE 30-SECOND TEST","subtitle":"readability metric","accent":"#2dd4a0"},"transcript":"The test is simple: can someone new to the codebase find what they need in under thirty seconds?","plannedDurationSec":22},{"id":"rc-b7","treatment":"chapter-card","params":{"title":"BE KIND TO FUTURE YOU","subtitle":"readable code is self-care","accent":"#ec6a5e"},"transcript":"Write code as if the person maintaining it is a violent psychopath who knows where you live. That person is you, six months from now.","plannedDurationSec":23}],"gates":{"schemaIssues":0,"timelineIssues":0,"warnings":[]}}}
